* LTspice Simulation Netlist converted from KiCad
.title KiCad schematic simulation

* --- Power Sources ---
V_VS VS 0 24
V_5V +5V 0 5

* --- Input Signals (10 kHz complement PWM) ---
V_IN1 IN1 0 PULSE(0 5 0 1u 1u 45u 100u)
V_IN2 IN2 0 PULSE(5 0 0 1u 1u 45u 100u)

* --- L6203 Driver Instantiation ---
* Pin order: OUT2 VS OUT1 BOOT1 IN1 GND IN2 BOOT2 SENSE EN VREF
XIC1 Net-_D3-A2_ VS Net-_D3-A1_ Net-_IC1-CBOOT1_ IN1 0 IN2 Net-_IC1-CBOOT2_ Net-_IC1-SENSE_ +5V Net-_IC1-VREF_ L6203

* --- L6203 Subcircuit ---
.SUBCKT L6203 OUT2 VS OUT1 BOOT1 IN1 GND IN2 BOOT2 SENSE EN VREF
M1 VS 41 3 3 DMOS_N
M2 3 51 GND GND DMOS_N
M3 VS 81 1 1 DMOS_N
M4 1 71 GND GND DMOS_N
E1 41 3 VALUE = { IF( V(IN1)>1.5 AND V(EN)>1.5, V(BOOT1)-V(3), 0 ) }
E2 51 GND VALUE = { IF( V(IN1)<0.8 AND V(EN)>1.5, 5, 0 ) }
E3 81 1 VALUE = { IF( V(IN2)>1.5 AND V(EN)>1.5, V(BOOT2)-V(1), 0 ) }
E4 71 GND VALUE = { IF( V(IN2)<0.8 AND V(EN)>1.5, 5, 0 ) }
R_SENSE GND SENSE 100k
V_REF VREF GND 5.0
.MODEL DMOS_N NMOS (VTO=2.5 KP=20 VMAX=1E6 RS=0.15 RD=0.15)
.ENDS L6203

* --- Passive and Support Components ---
C10 +5V 0 100n
